---
---

<section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2 class="visually-hidden" id="about-title">About Pacto</h2>

    <div class="split">
      <div class="split-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">The Problem</p>
        <h3 class="section-title">Don't give your data away</h3>
        <p class="section-body">
          Most community tools trade convenience for control. Your chats, member lists, and group
          decisions live on someone else's servers — readable, sellable, and one policy change away
          from disappearing. That is the wrong bargain for groups that need to organize privately.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="split-media">
        <div class="media-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Image placeholder">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
            ></rect>
            <circle cx="9" cy="10" r="1.75" fill="currentColor"></circle>
            <path
              d="M4 16l4.5-4.5L12 15l3-3 5 5"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="split split-flip">
      <div class="split-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">What is Pacto</p>
        <h3 class="section-title">A communication tool for your community</h3>
        <p class="section-body">
          Pacto is infrastructure for communities that want encrypted messaging, on-chain voting,
          and a shared treasury — without middlemen holding the keys. You run the group; the
          protocol carries the messages and records the decisions.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="split-media">
        <div class="media-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Image placeholder">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
            ></rect>
            <circle cx="9" cy="10" r="1.75" fill="currentColor"></circle>
            <path
              d="M4 16l4.5-4.5L12 15l3-3 5 5"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .visually-hidden {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
</style>
